# 统一使用 LF，避免 Windows 工作区产生 CRLF 导致 gofmt/CI/脚本执行噪声
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
# Windows 专属脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf